# Turbo / monorepo verify

adaptate sessions show **Shell** running `turbo run check-types` and test/coverage goals after package edits.

After changing `turbo.json`, package scripts, or `@adaptate/core`:

1. Run `turbo run check-types` (or project equivalent) for affected packages.
2. Run tests when adding test scripts or changing zod/schemas — do not assume green without Shell output.
3. For zod v4 migration work, grep deprecated APIs (`z.iso.*`) and fix call sites before claiming clean.

Treat "100% coverage" requests as requiring actual test run output, not file edits alone.
